$HOME/alphazede/worktrees/amazon-fantasy-companion-planning/docs/plans/2026-10-11-amazon-fantasy-companion/implementation.json:3982:    "outcome": "Phase 1 of the spec-first order (DEC-AFC-SD-023): D5 — one shared, repo-agnostic `spec-authoring` skill in the owner’s shared skills, generalized from the GridMarket spec kit; D4 — the shared, repo-agnostic CI/CD capability (`setup-pre-commit`, `setup-a-repo`, `ship-pull-request` extended, harness hooks calling the one gate entrypoint); this repository usable with them (one gate entrypoint with `spec`, `docs`, `hygiene` areas, vendored D5 tools, Vnv guidance tree); Scribe developer-feedback log started; the Phase 1 spec track ST-1..ST-5 (requirements register, SysML v2 models, D1 with D5, owner spec review) and the Phase 2 sequence P2-6..P2-7 planned with entry criteria.",
$HOME/alphazede/worktrees/amazon-fantasy-companion-planning/docs/plans/2026-10-11-amazon-fantasy-companion/implementation.json:3984:      "D5 shared spec-authoring skill in Alphazedehq (S06), linked into harness skill directories (S06L, S11)",
$HOME/alphazede/worktrees/amazon-fantasy-companion-planning/docs/plans/2026-10-11-amazon-fantasy-companion/implementation.json:3995:      "Copying the GridMarket kit into this repository as project-local skills (SD-013, superseded by SD-022). This repository gets only the vendored scripts of the shared D5 skill.",
